{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/components/schedule-for","title":"Progressive rendering with scheduleFor","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"progressive-rendering-with-schedulefor","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Progressive rendering with "},{"t":"code","text":"scheduleFor"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"forNode"},{"t":"text","text":" renders synchronously by default. That is the right choice for short"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"lists and keeps the initial behavior predictable. For a large collection,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"scheduleFor"},{"t":"text","text":" lets Craft spread fragment creation and updates over animation"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"frames."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"basic-usage","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Basic usage"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { forNode, scheduleFor } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"forNode","kind":"function"},{"text":"(cells, { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"track","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"cell"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" cell.id }, (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"cell"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"renderCell","kind":"function"},{"text":"(cell)).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"pipe","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"scheduleFor","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    enabled: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    strategy: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'frame'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    frameBudgetMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The directive is attached to the "},{"t":"code","text":"forNode"},{"t":"text","text":" node. It does not add a DOM wrapper and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"does not change the "},{"t":"code","text":"item"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"index"},{"t":"text","text":", dependency, exception, or pending-source"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"contracts of the block."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"when-to-use-it","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When to use it"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"strategy: 'frame'"},{"t":"text","text":" when the first visible items should appear quickly and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the browser must keep handling input and painting while the rest of the list is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"created. A smaller "},{"t":"code","text":"frameBudgetMs"},{"t":"text","text":" yields more often; a larger budget completes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the list sooner but can occupy the main thread for longer."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Disable it explicitly when a screen needs the synchronous behavior:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"forNode","kind":"function"},{"text":"(items, { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"track","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"item"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" item.id }, renderItem).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"pipe","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"scheduleFor","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ enabled: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"false","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", strategy: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'frame'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"forNode"},{"t":"text","text":" without "},{"t":"code","text":"scheduleFor"},{"t":"text","text":" is already synchronous. The first delivery"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"supports "},{"t":"code","text":"sync"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"frame"},{"t":"text","text":"; "},{"t":"code","text":"idle"},{"t":"text","text":" will be added with its fallback policy in a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"later delivery."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-scheduling-does—and-does-not-do","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What scheduling does—and does not do"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Scheduling improves perceived responsiveness by yielding between batches. It"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"does not reduce the total work required to create or update every fragment."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Stable keys still control reconciliation, and existing keyed DOM fragments keep"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"their identity when the collection is reordered."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For very large or continuously scrolling collections, prefer virtualisation:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it reduces the number of DOM nodes and bindings that exist at the same time."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Scheduling and virtualisation solve different problems and can eventually be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"combined."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"pixel-art-workshop","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pixel Art Workshop"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The demo's Pixel Art Workshop uses frame scheduling for its 256-cell grid:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"forNode","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"INDEXES"},{"text":", { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"track","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"index"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" index }, renderCell).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"pipe","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"scheduleFor","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ strategy: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'frame'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", frameBudgetMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4","kind":"number"},{"text":" }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The production benchmark can compare the synchronous baseline and frame mode"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with 256, 1,000, and 10,000 cells. Its commands and metrics are documented in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"docs/benchmarks/schedule-for-pixel-art.md"},{"t":"text","text":" in the repository."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"basic-usage","text":"Basic usage"},{"level":2,"id":"when-to-use-it","text":"When to use it"},{"level":2,"id":"what-scheduling-does—and-does-not-do","text":"What scheduling does—and does not do"},{"level":2,"id":"pixel-art-workshop","text":"Pixel Art Workshop"}]}